000000; font-size:x-large;'>NEXt-Generation RADar<\/span><\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><\/div><p><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'>This feature layer, utilizing National Geospatial Data Asset (NGDA) data from the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration (NOAA), displays Next-Generation Radar (NEXRAD).&nbsp;Per&nbsp;<\/span><a style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;' target='_blank' href='https://catalog.data.gov/dataset/noaa-next-generation-radar-nexrad-products' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:large;'>NOAA<\/span><\/a><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'>, \u201cNEXRAD is a network of 160 high-resolution Doppler weather radars operated by the NOAA National Weather Service (NWS), the Federal Aviation Administration (FAA), and the U.S. Air Force (USAF). Doppler radars detect atmospheric precipitation and winds, which allow scientists to track and anticipate weather events, such as rain, ice pellets, snow, hail, and tornadoes, as well as some non-weather objects like birds and insects.\u201d<\/span><\/p><div style='text-align:center;'><img src='https://fedmaps.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/e6a6052b83a84eddb9fafc7e6697acbb/data' alt='NGDA _ NOAA _ Next Generation Radar_NEXRAD _ 800x400 _ Screen Capture' /><\/div><div style='text-align:center;'><span style='font-size:large;'><i>Baltimore Washington NEXRAD<\/i><\/span><\/div><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;'><div style='font-family:inherit;'><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'><strong>Data currency:<\/strong>&nbsp;This cached Esri federal service is checked weekly for updates from its enterprise federal source (<\/font><\/span><a target='_blank' href='https://gis.ncdc.noaa.gov/arcgis/rest/services/cdo/nexrad/MapServer' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:large;'>NEXRAD<\/span><\/a><span style='color:rgb(0,0,0); font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'>) and will support mapping, analysis, data exports and OGC API \u2013 Feature access.<\/font><\/span><\/div><\/div><div style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif;'><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'><font style='color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:inherit;'><strong>NGDAID:<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/font><\/span><a style='font-family:&quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;' target='_blank' href='https://ngda-portfolio-community-geoplatform.hub.arcgis.com/pages/portfolio' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:large;'>30 (NOAA NEXt-Generation RADar (NEXRAD) Products)<\/span><\/a><\/div><div><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-position:initial; background-repeat:initial; background-size:initial; font-family:&quot;Avenir Next W01&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next W00&quot;, &quot;Avenir Next&quot;, Avenir, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; margin:0in 0in 0.0001pt;'><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'><strong>OGC API Features Link:<\/strong>&nbsp;(<\/font><\/span><a target='_blank' href='https://fedmaps.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=2e0aa98c8d844f12845d1d094efa23ed&amp;view=service' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:large;'>Next Generation Radar<\/span><\/a><span style='color:#000000; font-size:large;'><font style='font-family:inherit;'>) copy this link to embed it in OGC Compliant viewers<\/font><\/span><\/p><p style='background-attachment:initial; background-clip:initial; background-image:initial; background-origin:initial; background-posi